    "intro_narrative": "The rain batters against the window of the 42nd Precinct. You are Detective Hayes, and the 'Midnight Serial' case has just hit a dead end. The precinct's evidence room is a mess of scattered files, locked terminals, and encrypted drives. The chief has given you until dawn to identify the killer before the case is handed over to the Feds. To crack this, you'll need to piece together the scattered clues, cross-reference biometric data, and uncover the hidden motives. The final piece of the puzzle lies in the precinct's Final Verdict System, but it's locked behind multiple layers of cryptographic security. Time is running out, detective. Examine the evidence, find the connections, and close this case.",
    "narrative_style": "detective"
  },
